          "answer": "A",
          "explanation": "一般疑问句和礼貌问句用升调。"
        },
        {
          "type": "input",
          "level": "challenge",
          "difficulty": 3,
          "question": "填对话：—____? —My name is Mike.",
          "answer": "What's your name",
          "explanation": "根据回答 My name is… 反推问句是问名字的。"
        }
      ]
